  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Police Coord</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regional Police Coord</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet finansierar en heltids- regional polissamordnare i Belgrad och genomf&#xF6;rs av RPS som anst&#xE4;llt Vojkan Filipovic p&#xE5; tj&#xE4;nsten som samordnare. Samordnaren skall koordinera och vara behj&#xE4;lpig vid implementeringen av p&#xE5;g&#xE5;ende polisprojek i Serbien och Montenegro. Tj&#xE4;nsten har f&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngts till mars 2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds the full time presence of a regional police coordinator in Belgrade and is implemented through the SNPB who has hired Vojkan Filipovic. The coordinator should coordinate and facilitate all the current police reform projects implemented by SNPB in Serbia and Montenegro both internally and externally. The Coordinator has been extended until March 2010.</narrative>
  </description>
